 it overnight\"\n\nIn this 1-hour workshop, he builds that team from scratch, step by step\n\nJob → Chief of Staff → PMs → 50+ Workers → 60 Bots, One Budget\n\nMost people think 60 bots means 60x the bill. It doesn't if each bot only reads what its job needs\n\nPay for clear roles once, instead of paying every bot to re-read the whole chat\n\nWorth more than most $2,000 agent engineering courses\n\nWatch it today\n\nThe full setup: \"Wipe your data from the internet with Grok Bot\" ↓"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "This is f*cking insane. SpaceXAI senior engineer (ex-Cursor):\n\n\"I run 60+ Grok Bots like a company. A Chief of Staff runs my day, 3 PMs hand out the work, 50+ workers ship it overnight\"\n\nIn this 1-hour workshop, he builds that team from scratch, step by step\n\nJob → Chief of https://t.co/GwNOtYcQs2 https://t.co/RjthR9Ja8h", "url": "https://x.com/AshleyD75536765/status/2125008569078870148"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2125008520953389056"]}, "author_id": "46833787", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:28:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125008530709283279"], "id": "2125008530709283279", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok bot straight out refusing to create content on the topic i want today 👀\n\nWhich is how we cocreate our reality..\n\nStay $fuzzy 🐻✨️ https://t.co/MCt6Dm2rP5", "url": "https://x.com/HailTheFury/status/2125008530709283279"}, {"author_id": "50029325", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:28:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125008524916969874"], "id": "2125008524916969874", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok @bot @grok, can you check on that above", "url": "https://x.com/AaronJosephHall